    "realized_pct = (hit_close / entry - 1) * 100, i.e. simple % gain on the hit",
    "rows_to_target = trading rows after the down-day, not calendar days",
    "above_200ma_at_entry uses rolling(N, min_periods=N); first N-1 rows are NaN → 'below'",
    "source CSV contains exact-duplicate rows; dedupe on date before absolute counts",
    "Recommended refinement: gate alerts on above_200ma_at_entry == True",
    "Do NOT rank by annualized_pct — rank by hit_rate × gain − miss_rate × stop"
  ]
}